{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"julia","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Julia","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Julia (.jl).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"julia","name":"Julia","extensions":[".jl"],"grammar":"grammars/julia.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["#=","=#"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Julia","path":"snippets/julia.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/julia.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"#=\",\n      \"end\": \"=#\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \":[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:baremodule|abstract|continue|function|finally|mutable|elseif|export|global|import|module|struct|return|struct|begin|break|catch|const|local|macro|quote|using|where|while|type|else|end|for|isa|let|try|do|if|in)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:nothing|missing|false|true|NaN|Inf|pi)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Float64|String|Vector|Matrix|Number|Symbol|Int64|Array|Tuple|Bool|Char|Dict|Real|Int|Set|Any)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:println|collect|filter|reduce|length|print|push!|zeros|sort!|pop!|ones|rand|sort|map|sum)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/julia.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"function ${1:name}(${2:args})\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name}\",\n      \"\\t${2:field}::${3:Int}\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"For\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for ${1:i} in ${2:1:10}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"Module\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mod\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"module ${1:Name}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"end\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A module\"\n  },\n  \"Println\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"println(${1:value})\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"println\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Julia\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Julia.\n\n## Files\n\n`.jl`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `fn` | A function |\n| `struct` | A struct |\n| `for` | A for loop |\n| `mod` | A module |\n| `pl` | println |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}